# Default: all text files use LF (WSL2/Linux standard)
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files must use CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Shell scripts must use LF
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary files
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary

# 2026-09-01 将軍 D0: queue/insights.yaml は origin(autopush: source-only insights ID merge)と共有 root の両方が追記する台帳。
